---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Project Discovery"
  description="Start with a quick project request so Lowcountry Digital Works can understand what you need and choose the right human follow-up."
  noindex
>
  <section class="page-hero page-hero--warm">
    <div class="container discovery-hero">
      <div class="discovery-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">A clear first step</p>
        <h1>Tell us what you're trying to improve.</h1>
        <p class="lede">You don't need to diagnose the problem or write out every detail. Start with a quick request so we know what you need help with and how you want us to follow up. We'll work through the rest together.</p>
        <div class="discovery-start">
          <a
            class="button"
            href="https://getaiform.com/r/LiY9XI9qKE"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
          >Start a quick project request <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <p class="small">About 2 minutes. The request opens in a new tab.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="discovery-summary" aria-labelledby="discovery-summary-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p>
        <h2 id="discovery-summary-title">A few useful details, then a human review.</h2>
        <ul class="proof-list">
          <li>Choose the areas you want help with instead of writing a long technical explanation.</li>
          <li>“Not sure” is a useful answer. You don't need to know which service or solution you need.</li>
          <li>If you're starting fresh, a domain or business-name idea is enough—we can check availability later.</li>
          <li>Tell us how you'd prefer to hear back. We only ask for a phone number if you choose call or text.</li>
          <li>We'll review your answers with any relevant materials you've already shared, so you shouldn't have to send them again.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If more detail would help, we'll handle it in the conversation or use focused follow-up questions rather than asking you to complete a long intake up front.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="discovery-steps-title">
    <div class="container discovery-content">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">After you submit</p>
        <h2 id="discovery-steps-title">We'll help you find the right next step.</h2>
        <p>Eddie will review the request and follow up in the way you selected. The first conversation is where we'll sort out the useful details together, including what already exists or what you're starting from scratch, what you want to change or create, and what would make the project worthwhile.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="discovery-details">
        <h2>Already shared your materials?</h2>
        <p>If Eddie already has your mission statement, photos, logo, screenshots, or other project materials, you don't need to send the same files again.</p>
        <p>There are no public file uploads here. If we need more, we'll agree on an appropriate private way to share it.</p>

        <div class="discovery-secondary">
          <h3>Prefer to write out more before we talk?</h3>
          <p>The longer questionnaire is still available, but it is optional. Most people should start with the quick request.</p>
          <a
            class="text-link"
            href="https://getaiform.com/r/XAqAsatn7H"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
          >Open the detailed project questions <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--warm" aria-labelledby="discovery-privacy-title">
    <div class="container discovery-privacy">
      <div class="discovery-privacy__mark" aria-hidden="true">!</div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Please keep sensitive information out</p>
        <h2 id="discovery-privacy-title">Share the context, not the secrets.</h2>
        <p>Do not submit passwords, MFA or recovery codes, API keys or tokens, payment-card or bank information, protected health information, CUI or government-restricted information, or confidential customer or client records. If special handling may be needed, say so without including the sensitive details and we'll discuss a suitable channel.</p>
        <p>Read our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Notice</a> for more about how Lowcountry Digital Works handles information.</p>
        <div class="discovery-actions">
          <a
            class="button button--secondary"
            href="https://getaiform.com/r/LiY9XI9qKE"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
          >Start the quick request <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a
            class="text-link"
            href="https://getaiform.com/r/XAqAsatn7H"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
          >Use the detailed project questions instead <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.discovery-hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(17rem, .8fr);
  gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  align-items: center;
}

.discovery-intro h1 { max-width: 13ch; }
.discovery-start { margin-top: 1.6rem; }
.discovery-start .small { margin: .7rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
.discovery-summary {
  padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--interactive);
  border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
  background: var(--surface);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgb(16 42 58 / .08);
}
.discovery-summary h2, .discovery-content h2, .discovery-privacy h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem);
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.discovery-summary .proof-list { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.discovery-summary > p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.discovery-content {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
}
.discovery-details {
  padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  background: var(--surface);
}
.discovery-details h2 { margin-top: 0; }
.discovery-details > p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }
.discovery-secondary {
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
  padding-top: 1.25rem;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.discovery-secondary h3 {
  margin: 0 0 .45rem;
  font-size: 1rem;
}
.discovery-secondary p { margin: 0 0 .6rem; }
.discovery-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: .8rem 1rem;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: .5rem;
}
.discovery-actions .button { margin-top: 0; }
.discovery-privacy {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 1.25rem;
  align-items: start;
}
.discovery-privacy__mark {
  display: grid;
  width: 2.5rem;
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  place-items: center;
  border: 2px solid var(--interactive);
  border-radius: 50%;
  color: var(--interactive);
  font-weight: 800;
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .discovery-hero, .discovery-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .discovery-summary { border-left-width: 3px; }
  .discovery-privacy { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .75rem; }
  .discovery-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>
